 "headline": "Tatum Buries Gopher Gold's Rivals Early",
 "notes": [
  "Jayson Tatum dropped 41 points with six threes for theInfamous, and the team still trails Gopher Gold 8-3. Somebody has to explain that.",
  "Anthony Davis has 33 points and 13 rebounds on 12-of-21 shooting for LeParth James, who lead Nova Knicks 7-4 while the other side hasn't produced a single stat.",
